# `RosenzweigMacArthur`, reduced by nondim, checked against the general theory

Auto-generated by `nondim certify`. Do not edit: change the model and regenerate.

About: Rational right-hand side. Expect 6 -> 3.

Variables (Lean index order): 0 = N, 1 = P, 2 = r, 3 = K, 4 = a, 5 = h, 6 = e, 7 = m

Equations:
    dN/dt = -N*P*a/(N*a*h + 1) + N*r*(1 - N/K)
    dP/dt = N*P*a*e/(N*a*h + 1) - P*m

New time: r*t
Invariants (the new variables):
    π 0 = N_hat = N/K
    π 1 = P_hat = P*a/r
    π 2 = h_hat = K*a*h
    π 3 = e_hat = K*a*e/r
    π 4 = m_hat = m/r
Auxiliary monomials (set to 1): r, K, a

Reduced equations (ν = the new variable for each state, τ = the new time):
    dN_hat/dτ = N_hat*(-P_hat - (N_hat - 1)*(N_hat*h_hat + 1))/(N_hat*h_hat + 1)
    dP_hat/dτ = P_hat*(N_hat*e_hat - m_hat*(N_hat*h_hat + 1))/(N_hat*h_hat + 1)

