/-- Reduced right-hand side for `N` as a sum of quotients. It equals the one reported by
nondim, `N_hat*(-P_hat - (N_hat - 1)*(N_hat*h_hat + 1))/(N_hat*h_hat + 1)` (that equality is checked in Python). -/
noncomputable def red_N (π : Fin 5 → ℝ) : ℝ := rnum_N_0 π / rden_N_0 π + rnum_N_1 π / rden_N_1 π

/-- `(factor of the new variable) * (right-hand side)  =  (time factor) * (reduced right-hand
side at the invariants)`, at every positive point, quotient by quotient. -/
theorem reduced_identity_N (z : Fin 8 → ℝ) (hz : ∀ j, 0 < z j) :
